#: a95e2ad575344640a47c065bd932000b
msgid "数据解析"
msgstr "Data Parsing"

#: b5ad52e4206d4c88b154a5a3f9a6ef59
msgid "计算周期性边界条件下，近邻原子相对于中心原子的偏移向量。"
msgstr ""
"Calculate the offset vector of a neighboring atom relative to the central "
"atom under periodic boundary conditions."

#: a5efc5ee5b7d4829bdc93ad338f2dbe1
msgid "在晶体中，一个原子的近邻可能位于相邻的晶胞中。这个函数通过晶格矢量 和周期性偏移镜像（image）来计算这种跨晶胞的实际位移。"
msgstr ""
"In a crystal, the neighbors of an atom may be in adjacent unit cells. This "
"function calculates the actual displacement across unit cells using lattice "
"vectors and the periodic offset (image)."

#: 255159e02fa64e4baebf1ff43e6b87a8 41a6b40e608a40bfadd9f66befdf9d8f
#: a7af8c6c950d445fa12f4ff017622aad d9dae5cb6f334226a265b615b1f92f3d
msgid "参数"
msgstr "Parameters"

#: a1eec78b85844778bfeca63297ae5a7b
msgid "形状为 `(3,)` 的整数数组，表示近邻原子所在的晶胞相对于 中心原子所在晶胞的周期性偏移（例如 `[-1, 0, 1]`）。"
msgstr ""
"An integer array of shape `(3,)` representing the periodic offset of the "
"unit cell containing the neighboring atom relative to the unit cell of the "
"central atom (e.g., `[-1, 0, 1]` )."

#: a782c403aad74aa29f31a327265e6243
msgid "形状为 `(3, 3)` 的数组，表示晶胞的三个晶格矢量。"
msgstr ""
"An array of shape `(3, 3)` representing the three lattice vectors of the "
"unit cell."

#: 6e2a39ef658d4826979e6c6ee81d348f a8db77e77e224655a45b15fc07c3d479
#: bd1c4806dbe841a0b9cbd6cd20902275
msgid "返回"
msgstr "Returns"

#: af98387b4f4341f6b32625f140484c47
msgid "形状为 `(3,)` 的实际偏移向量。"
msgstr "The actual offset vector of shape `(3,)`."

#: 3d68292dfc024197ae9599e15cbafb12 76a09b0c3925424cbc7b5495e4598bc0
#: cbe1bdd5e1484bafb80a70ce3db792b6
msgid "返回类型"
msgstr "Return type"

#: 95a1600dacde4d84a9e45b8a4e6fc448
msgid "扫描所有晶体文件，构建原子类型的 one-hot 编码配置。"
msgstr ""
"Scan all crystal files to build a one-hot encoding configuration for atom "
"types."

#: 37868990b8694450937ebf542f7a789c
msgid ""
"该函数会遍历指定路径下的所有晶体结构文件，统计出数据集中出现的所有 原子类型（以原子序数 Z 表示），然后为每种原子创建一个 one-hot "
"编码向量。 最终的配置信息将保存为一个 JSON 文件。"
msgstr ""
"This function iterates through all crystal structure files in the specified "
"path, identifies all atom types (represented by atomic number Z) present in "
"the dataset, and then creates a one-hot encoding vector for each atom type. "
"The final configuration is saved as a JSON file."

#: 140552e7bb5a46db8c89bbf6ae4058a8
msgid ""
"项目的主配置对象，需要包含以下路径信息：  - `dataset_params.csv_params.crystal_path`: "
"晶体文件所在目录。 - `dataset_params.csv_params.file_type`: 晶体文件类型 ('poscar' 或 "
"'cif')。 - `dataset_params.graph_data_path`: one-hot 配置文件 "
"`config_onehot.json` 的保存路径。"
msgstr ""
"The main configuration object for the project, which must contain the "
"following path information: - `dataset_params.csv_params.crystal_path`: "
"Directory containing crystal files. - "
"`dataset_params.csv_params.file_type`: Crystal file type ('poscar' or "
"'cif'). - `dataset_params.graph_data_path`: Save path for the one-hot "
"configuration file `config_onehot.json`."

#: 20d7be552b8a43798df230d4f3f46645
msgid "项目的主配置对象，需要包含以下路径信息："
msgstr ""
"The main configuration object for the project, which must contain the "
"following path information:"

#: 734b84efc8a24316920e57999a00a602
msgid "`dataset_params.csv_params.crystal_path`: 晶体文件所在目录。"
msgstr ""
"`dataset_params.csv_params.crystal_path`: Directory containing crystal "
"files."

#: 56875b1798d44f408fdcb6876ad4d8be
msgid "`dataset_params.csv_params.file_type`: 晶体文件类型 ('poscar' 或 'cif')。"
msgstr ""
"`dataset_params.csv_params.file_type`: Crystal file type ('poscar' or "
"'cif')."

#: c5931ea472aa43e7b38e5c0611545fda
msgid "`dataset_params.graph_data_path`: one-hot 配置文件 `config_onehot.json` 的保存路径。"
msgstr ""
"`dataset_params.graph_data_path`: Save path for the one-hot configuration "
"file `config_onehot.json`."

#: 051c0205c7e444e0bda08394add783eb
#, python-brace-format
msgid ""
"一个包含原子序数列表和对应 one-hot 编码矩阵的字典。 例如： `{'atomic_numbers': [1, 6, 8], "
"'node_vectors': [[1,0,0], [0,1,0], [0,0,1]]}`"
msgstr ""
"A dictionary containing a list of atomic numbers and the corresponding one-"
"hot encoding matrix. For example: `{'atomic_numbers': [1, 6, 8], "
"'node_vectors': [[1,0,0], [0,1,0], [0,0,1]]}`"

#: c7955406b9de436d86ec7eb0693f090c
msgid "根据 one-hot 配置文件为晶体中的每个原子生成初始特征向量。"
msgstr ""
"Generate initial feature vectors for each atom in the crystal based on the "
"one-hot configuration file."

#: 1581017b844f470fa8917e6e3c872cc1
msgid "由 `build_config` 生成的 one-hot 配置字典，包含 'atomic_numbers' 和 'node_vectors'。"
msgstr ""
"The one-hot configuration dictionary generated by `build_config`, "
"containing 'atomic_numbers' and 'node_vectors'."

#: 763eaac9eac54ab4800b97a00e81b9a1
msgid "一个 `pymatgen.core.structure.Structure` 对象，代表单个晶体结构。"
msgstr ""
"A `pymatgen.core.structure.Structure` object representing a single crystal "
"structure."

#: 3eac1edfc2d247a5bc11773e18ccc0ba
msgid "形状为 `(N, D)` 的数组，其中 N 是晶体中的原子数，D 是 one-hot 向量的维度。 每一行是对应原子的 one-hot 特征。"
msgstr ""
"An array of shape `(N, D)`, where N is the number of atoms in the crystal "
"and D is the dimension of the one-hot vector. Each row is the one-hot "
"feature for the corresponding atom."

#: 25ea8a71210d4525bc27c81eb418c8f5
msgid "解析所有晶体文件和属性文件，生成并保存图数据。"
msgstr "Parse all crystal and property files to generate and save graph data."

#: b2cd7fd866a4453bb9278820d1c8bda3
msgid "这是数据预处理的核心函数。它执行以下步骤："
msgstr ""
"This is the core function for data preprocessing. It performs the following "
"steps:"

#: fd66a96f7e204d92959a39d8e8be36a7
msgid "确定晶体文件的类型和路径。"
msgstr "Determine the type and path of crystal files."

#: da3a8356331643ad88bc5361b27f9b6e
msgid "加载或创建原子 one-hot 编码配置。"
msgstr "Load or create the atomic one-hot encoding configuration."

#: 8a1d0634a833423cb6b3cedbec911416
msgid "从 `id_prop.csv` 文件中读取每个晶体ID及其对应的目标属性。"
msgstr ""
"Read each crystal ID and its corresponding target properties from the "
"`id_prop.csv` file."

#: b759155ef9ae4992aee4ad2fd4b7f1b2
msgid "遍历每个晶体ID，执行以下操作："
msgstr "Iterate through each crystal ID and perform the following operations:"

#: 258e9820e4bd40be9927f9f501bf4bcc
msgid "读取晶体结构。"
msgstr "Read the crystal structure."

#: 0ddf72dc04944ac3b1d5c51960f9dcb9
msgid "生成原子特征（node_attr）。"
msgstr "Generate atom features (node_attr)."

#: 89a7e5ac2ac341aba99ee45daf4fffd2
msgid "寻找近邻，构建边列表（edge_index）和周期性偏移（nbr_shift）。"
msgstr ""
"Find neighbors to construct the edge list (edge_index) and periodic shifts "
"(nbr_shift)."

#: 9ab48bceb7104712bda5792cdd2ba5cd
msgid "将所有信息（节点、边、属性等）组装成 `torch_geometric.data.Data` 对象。"
msgstr ""
"Assemble all information (nodes, edges, properties, etc.) into a "
"`torch_geometric.data.Data` object."

#: 6434e105e8094686b3a38dbee32b92c6
msgid "将所有图数据存储在一个字典中，并使用 `np.savez` 保存为压缩的 `.npz` 文件。"
msgstr ""
"Store all graph data in a dictionary and save it as a compressed `.npz` "
"file using `np.savez`."

#: 8d618cea7a5b4ac895ceebc204987967
msgid "项目的主配置对象，提供了所有必需的参数，例如文件路径、截断半径、 最大近邻数以及目标属性的格式等。"
msgstr ""
"The main configuration object for the project, providing all necessary "
"parameters such as file paths, cutoff radius, maximum number of neighbors, "
"and the format of target properties."